      },
      "sourceID": "webp-2ch-16-7",
      "fixedWEBText": "At that time Hanani the seer came to Asa king of Judah, and said to him, “Because you have relied on the king of Syria, and have not relied on the LORD your God, therefore the army of the king of Syria has escaped out of your hand.",
      "beforeTextJa": "16章7節にもこの場所名が現れます。",
      "afterTextJa": "預言者ハナニは、アサが主ではなくシリア王を頼ったため、シリア軍を手から逃したと告げます。",
      "oldDraftSHA256": "ab749e9d4e00b75c31b27558ff1db0c967e026cd2f2031c3c3fbb0c8214dbf1c",
      "newDraftSHA256": "e58a2a396301316722bc8a887f269672803412b44b3a3c166dfb1161300bc684",
      "newProfileSHA256": "f3181c6179a172a965e40bd9e1522c2bc09ae9d6ddbcb0ebee68463093b0de4f",
      "oldEvidenceDraftSHA256": "c57c33699a9adc56aed39fe81906841dcabb60047abbe8f6b185a8fb42f106d2",
      "oldEvidenceProfileSHA256": "475258b8e4731d477a84deba75ddd630df2db84ec9d9cbe6c2b7172d6d82e0e1",
      "newEvidenceSHA256": "bc95d9019a0fb874ba40e234362a97fbd09e109b267e7f877f4c843c82dcb8cd",
      "rationaleJa": "章節番号の案内だけだったfactを、固定WEB該当節が具体的に述べる行為・対象へ置換。意味範囲・地名同定は引用文を超えて広げない。"
    },
    {
      "draftPath": "drafts/places_3/2CH_syria_1122.json",
      "entityID": "place:syria_1122",
      "field": "profile.facts[2].textJa",
      "knownBy": {
        "chapter": 18,
        "verse": 30
      },
      "sourceID": "webp-2ch-18-30",
      "fixedWEBText": "Now the king of Syria had commanded the captains of his chariots, saying, “Don’t fight with small nor great, except only with the king of Israel.”",
      "beforeTextJa": "18章30節にもこの場所名が現れます。",
      "afterTextJa": "シリア王は戦車隊長たちに、イスラエル王以外の者とは戦わないよう命じたと記されています。",
      "oldDraftSHA256": "ab749e9d4e00b75c31b27558ff1db0c967e026cd2f2031c3c3fbb0c8214dbf1c",
      "newDraftSHA256": "99a27e93fbd3b9acb58b737d9b8f5864222e069cb3c0359b302db85901d1dd35",
      "newProfileSHA256": "056628d4e0373e0360a3ffd28eb2205226431ca3f864918f91c4cea5c42519c1",
      "oldEvidenceDraftSHA256": "e58a2a396301316722bc8a887f269672803412b44b3a3c166dfb1161300bc684",
      "oldEvidenceProfileSHA256": "f3181c6179a172a965e40bd9e1522c2bc09ae9d6ddbcb0ebee68463093b0de4f",
      "newEvidenceSHA256": "fb775952176a33ea3871c27fcc5341c1c40f8badffeca647c2814742ba035a4f",
      "rationaleJa": "章節番号の案内だけだったfactを、固定WEB該当節が具体的に述べる行為・対象へ置換。意味範囲・地名同定は引用文を超えて広げない。"
    },
    {
      "draftPath": "drafts/places_3/2CH_syria_1122.json",
      "entityID": "place:syria_1122",
      "field": "profile.facts[3].textJa",
      "knownBy": {
        "chapter": 22,
        "verse": 5
      },
      "sourceID": "webp-2ch-22-5",
      "fixedWEBText": "He also followed their counsel, and went with Jehoram the son of Ahab king of Israel to war against Hazael king of Syria at Ramoth Gilead; and the Syrians wounded Joram.",
      "beforeTextJa": "22章5節にもこの場所名が現れます。",
      "afterTextJa": "ユダ王アハズヤはヨラムとともにラモト・ギレアドでシリア王ハザエルと戦い、シリア軍はヨラムを負傷させました。",
      "oldDraftSHA256": "ab749e9d4e00b75c31b27558ff1db0c967e026cd2f2031c3c3fbb0c8214dbf1c",
      "newDraftSHA256": "931864aeb948eabca22e1d8139f804ba13952cc440a17e7a42adbd4011feb01b",
      "newProfileSHA256": "5830ac100cdf40c71699f4cf3c2db0c942cabf1079ce1450daa6cf1d84b2a580",
      "oldEvidenceDraftSHA256": "99a27e93fbd3b9acb58b737d9b8f5864222e069cb3c0359b302db85901d1dd35",
      "oldEvidenceProfileSHA256": "056628d4e0373e0360a3ffd28eb2205226431ca3f864918f91c4cea5c42519c1",
      "newEvidenceSHA256": "51469d6358dcccc74d97f30a52477dd60c5c9075375af9a6faf2348adc27857e",
      "rationaleJa": "章節番号の案内だけだったfactを、固定WEB該当節が具体的に述べる行為・対象へ置換。意味範囲・地名同定は引用文を超えて広げない。"
    },
    {
      "draftPath": "drafts/places_3/2CH_syria_1122.json",
      "entityID": "place:syria_1122",
      "field": "profile.facts[4].textJa",
      "knownBy": {
        "chapter": 22,
        "verse": 6
      },
      "sourceID": "webp-2ch-22-6",
      "fixedWEBText": "He returned to be healed in Jezreel of the wounds which they had given him at Ramah, when he fought against Hazael king of Syria. Azariah the son of Jehoram, king of Judah, went down to see Jehoram the son of Ahab in Jezreel, because he was sick.",
      "beforeTextJa": "22章6節にもこの場所名が現れます。",
      "afterTextJa": "負傷したヨラムはイズレエルで療養し、アハズヤは彼を見舞います。ヨラムの傷は、シリア王ハザエルとの戦いで受けたものでした。",
      "oldDraftSHA256": "ab749e9d4e00b75c31b27558ff1db0c967e026cd2f2031c3c3fbb0c8214dbf1c",
      "newDraftSHA256": "8f77576443a4b474fdd6157b96b6e023132bb5bf3d1c59968272f35dd6d1d72f",
      "newProfileSHA256": "9d62f826aadd127fb116e30d9c4aef8b23b15c7dec3645e8a8722e30d73f6583",
      "oldEvidenceDraftSHA256": "931864aeb948eabca22e1d8139f804ba13952cc440a17e7a42adbd4011feb01b",
      "oldEvidenceProfileSHA256": "5830ac100cdf40c71699f4cf3c2db0c942cabf1079ce1450daa6cf1d84b2a580",
      "newEvidenceSHA256": "59247e8b17f032773f5e793d52ebbf40e458a80e0cc6ad7deac3623aff7740cc",
      "rationaleJa": "章節番号の案内だけだったfactを、固定WEB該当節が具体的に述べる行為・対象へ置換。意味範囲・地名同定は引用文を超えて広げない。"
    },
    {
      "draftPath": "drafts/places_3/2CH_syria_1122.json",
      "entityID": "place:syria_1122",
      "field": "profile.facts[5].textJa",
      "knownBy": {
        "chapter": 28,
        "verse": 5
      },
      "sourceID": "webp-2ch-28-5",
      "fixedWEBText": "Therefore the LORD his God delivered him into the hand of the king of Syria. They struck him, and carried away from him a great multitude of captives, and brought them to Damascus. He was also delivered into the hand of the king of Israel, who struck him with a great slaughter.",
      "beforeTextJa": "28章5節にもこの場所名が現れます。",
      "afterTextJa": "主はアハズをシリア王の手に渡し、シリア軍は多くの捕虜を奪ってダマスカスへ連れて行ったと記されます。",
      "oldDraftSHA256": "ab749e9d4e00b75c31b27558ff1db0c967e026cd2f2031c3c3fbb0c8214dbf1c",
      "newDraftSHA256": "10eb4897086af71933b7f993139c2a6197a38532e11a685c6766398f74db8592",
      "newProfileSHA256": "f44e0a1f52ce8b411476ae4ccfca90722054bc921ed0630da054ae9036be5904",
      "oldEvidenceDraftSHA256": "8f77576443a4b474fdd6157b96b6e023132bb5bf3d1c59968272f35dd6d1d72f",
      "oldEvidenceProfileSHA256": "9d62f826aadd127fb116e30d9c4aef8b23b15c7dec3645e8a8722e30d73f6583",
      "newEvidenceSHA256": "36227fa2f077818b23275169e77af9f42172c1f270c4d604f93b040aebe012b3",
      "rationaleJa": "章節番号の案内だけだったfactを、固定WEB該当節が具体的に述べる行為・対象へ置換。意味範囲・地名同定は引用文を超えて広げない。"
    },
    {
      "draftPath": "drafts/places_3/2CH_syria_1122.json",
      "entityID": "place:syria_1122",
      "field": "profile.facts[6].textJa",
      "knownBy": {
        "chapter": 28,
        "verse": 23
      },
      "sourceID": "webp-2ch-28-23",
      "fixedWEBText": "For he sacrificed to the gods of Damascus which had defeated him. He said, “Because the gods of the kings of Syria helped them, I will sacrifice to them, that they may help me.” But they were the ruin of him and of all Israel.",
      "beforeTextJa": "28章23節にもこの場所名が現れます。",
      "afterTextJa": "アハズはダマスカスの神々にいけにえをささげ、シリアの王たちを助けた神々だと考えましたが、その行為は彼とイスラエル全体の没落につながったと記されます。",
      "oldDraftSHA256": "ab749e9d4e00b75c31b27558ff1db0c967e026cd2f2031c3c3fbb0c8214dbf1c",
      "newDraftSHA256": "e97975ffc4577c60f01e95521d4fa3af1fc5e663ad1188853d240e146e49185d",
      "newProfileSHA256": "29dbe0a597b36e13c2bcec4c8dcf3c2523e853d5a1498934726bb8bc961aa8a5",
      "oldEvidenceDraftSHA256": "10eb4897086af71933b7f993139c2a6197a38532e11a685c6766398f74db8592",
      "oldEvidenceProfileSHA256": "f44e0a1f52ce8b411476ae4ccfca90722054bc921ed0630da054ae9036be5904",
      "newEvidenceSHA256": "79431d49c4d094a8c3b25bf6df97191c28c5091f7258c340b71accd88bd4cc39",
      "rationaleJa": "章節番号の案内だけだったfactを、固定WEB該当節が具体的に述べる行為・対象へ置換。意味範囲・地名同定は引用文を超えて広げない。"
    },
    {
      "draftPath": "drafts/places_3/2CH_shephelah_1074.json",
      "entityID": "place:shephelah_1074",
      "field": "profile.facts[0].textJa",
      "knownBy": {
        "chapter": 9,
        "verse": 27
      },
      "sourceID": "webp-2ch-9-27",
      "fixedWEBText": "The king made silver as common in Jerusalem as stones, and he made cedars to be as abundant as the sycamore trees that are in the lowland.",
      "beforeTextJa": "9章27節にもこの場所名が現れます。",
      "afterTextJa": "低地ではシカモアの木が多く、銀が石のようにありふれていたことにたとえて、杉も豊富だったと記されます。この節の「低地」はシェフェラと特定されていません。",
      "oldDraftSHA256": "4afbe9738d339f022abdc2f29495d74f141ffddd8af12d0ff9f166ca8ee54852",
      "newDraftSHA256": "8454c1bb6bf4190d09f083b6bb9a2ebebaa580e4ab112c76982f60e0a1604032",
      "newProfileSHA256": "c6036c958d249ee899cdf600c978e77b6ad2687913848edcfd591d7d42962923",
      "oldEvidenceDraftSHA256": "4afbe9738d339f022abdc2f29495d74f141ffddd8af12d0ff9f166ca8ee54852",
      "oldEvidenceProfileSHA256": "68f4485fb9f74d726a665027527d08c4b9cf827c1ac10f8601a3e906bd868f73",
      "newEvidenceSHA256": "df0130a361348563064ee2e3c098c3ecadaacf6e8de8ad8a10ce263f3676bdda",
      "rationaleJa": "章節番号の案内だけだったfactを、固定WEB該当節が具体的に述べる行為・対象へ置換。意味範囲・地名同定は引用文を超えて広げない。"
    },
    {
      "draftPath": "drafts/places_3/2CH_shephelah_1074.json",
      "entityID": "place:shephelah_1074",
      "field": "profile.facts[1].textJa",
      "knownBy": {
        "chapter": 26,
        "verse": 10
      },
      "sourceID": "webp-2ch-26-10",
      "fixedWEBText": "He built towers in the wilderness, and dug out many cisterns, for he had much livestock, both in the lowlands and in the plains. He had farmers and vineyard keepers in the mountains and in the fruitful fields, for he loved farming.",
      "beforeTextJa": "26章10節にもこの場所名が現れます。",
      "afterTextJa": "ウジヤは家畜を多く持ち、低地や平地に水槽を掘り、山地や肥沃な畑では農夫やぶどう栽培者を置いたと記されます。「低地」が特定のシェフェラを指すとは本文だけでは確定できません。",
      "oldDraftSHA256": "4afbe9738d339f022abdc2f29495d74f141ffddd8af12d0ff9f166ca8ee54852",
      "newDraftSHA256": "d362d1f494a332033bf3bea2def11c4880fe3abcfa3ad8d96cf3ec873def2437",
      "newProfileSHA256": "44ecc197e5e0e7312900d822113a4b4ad6e4eab290f54b995752df02d02a54fb",
      "oldEvidenceDraftSHA256": "8454c1bb6bf4190d09f083b6bb9a2ebebaa580e4ab112c76982f60e0a1604032",
      "oldEvidenceProfileSHA256": "c6036c958d249ee899cdf600c978e77b6ad2687913848edcfd591d7d42962923",
      "newEvidenceSHA256": "764c7521eef43813210ca105e186ef9fdf80505c2105035da9bbf9104dd71e20",
      "rationaleJa": "章節番号の案内だけだったfactを、固定WEB該当節が具体的に述べる行為・対象へ置換。意味範囲・地名同定は引用文を超えて広げない。"
    },
    {
      "draftPath": "drafts/places_3/2CH_shephelah_1074.json",
      "entityID": "place:shephelah_1074",
      "field": "profile.facts[2].textJa",
      "knownBy": {
        "chapter": 28,
        "verse": 18
      },
      "sourceID": "webp-2ch-28-18",
      "fixedWEBText": "The Philistines also had invaded the cities of the lowland and of the South of Judah, and had taken Beth Shemesh, Aijalon, Gederoth, Soco with its villages, Timnah with its villages, and also Gimzo and its villages; and they lived there.",
      "beforeTextJa": "28章18節にもこの場所名が現れます。",
      "afterTextJa": "ペリシテ人はユダ南部と低地の町々を攻め、ベテ・シェメシュ、アヤロン、ゲデロト、ソコ、ティムナ、ギムゾなどを占領したと記されます。「低地」はこの節でシェフェラと名指されてはいません。",
      "oldDraftSHA256": "4afbe9738d339f022abdc2f29495d74f141ffddd8af12d0ff9f166ca8ee54852",
      "newDraftSHA256": "2609cfa776cea7ae7b4d326eaf7890aeceb7f921991f4c8809bb78595bfc542c",
      "newProfileSHA256": "afba76af649804f5dbc17ba87e8d11296ea57ef147e936cbca981890479fafb0",
      "oldEvidenceDraftSHA256": "d362d1f494a332033bf3bea2def11c4880fe3abcfa3ad8d96cf3ec873def2437",
      "oldEvidenceProfileSHA256": "44ecc197e5e0e7312900d822113a4b4ad6e4eab290f54b995752df02d02a54fb",
      "newEvidenceSHA256": "6864c1a39624222d3bfa4c3c30cc914fcf73b6cfcfd38680d74a11c32969dd54",
      "rationaleJa": "章節番号の案内だけだったfactを、固定WEB該当節が具体的に述べる行為・対象へ置換。意味範囲・地名同定は引用文を超えて広げない。"
    },
    {
      "draftPath": "drafts/places_3/2CH_holy_place_575.json",
      "entityID": "place:holy_place_575",
      "field": "profile.facts[0].textJa",
      "knownBy": {
        "chapter": 29,
        "verse": 5
      },
      "sourceID": "webp-2ch-29-5",
      "fixedWEBText": "and said to them, “Listen to me, you Levites! Now sanctify yourselves, and sanctify the house of the LORD, the God of your fathers, and carry the filthiness out of the holy place.",
      "beforeTextJa": "29章5節にもこの場所名が現れます。",
      "afterTextJa": "ヒゼキヤはレビ人に、自らを聖別し、主の神殿から汚れを取り除くよう命じます。",
      "oldDraftSHA256": "d63ada2d22f3965da9d6e885591aa1b72a824568d3eb71ede724cfb734d01e28",
      "newDraftSHA256": "d86e3e8fb47cfffde8cbe32b9d279fd1ee4e7d3dbbb59b0a5db321e2d8af1841",
      "newProfileSHA256": "50dcabe592bce227b6942e1141023bfdbef1a853ab787e128bb9b05433e16aae",
      "oldEvidenceDraftSHA256": "d63ada2d22f3965da9d6e885591aa1b72a824568d3eb71ede724cfb734d01e28",
      "oldEvidenceProfileSHA256": "d98e6310df3828870f42cae43002cdc8b1a2743049c52d4eff892e6ebf2e0391",
      "newEvidenceSHA256": "c05b3d58eee330c6cc1017c786b229541600eec1f94a40260bd26a6d9a87be2f",
      "rationaleJa": "章節番号の案内だけだったfactを、固定WEB該当節が具体的に述べる行為・対象へ置換。意味範囲・地名同定は引用文を超えて広げない。"
    },
    {
      "draftPath": "drafts/places_3/2CH_holy_place_575.json",
      "entityID": "place:holy_place_575",
      "field": "profile.facts[1].textJa",
      "knownBy": {
        "chapter": 29,
        "verse": 7
      },
      "sourceID": "webp-2ch-29-7",
      "fixedWEBText": "Also they have shut up the doors of the porch, and put out the lamps, and have not burned incense nor offered burnt offerings in the holy place to the God of Israel.",
      "beforeTextJa": "29章7節にもこの場所名が現れます。",
      "afterTextJa": "ヒゼキヤは神殿の戸が閉ざされ、ともしびが消え、聖所で香や焼き尽くす献げ物がささげられなくなっていたと述べます。",
      "oldDraftSHA256": "d63ada2d22f3965da9d6e885591aa1b72a824568d3eb71ede724cfb734d01e28",
      "newDraftSHA256": "67bdcf6a60c0b602ded5207f1224e90e9bcbabf86bc7be7ee67daaa347bce125",
      "newProfileSHA256": "dbf3820b20e3d9bf25ed9b94d017ad0f76040a5e5ffb3447ea262e0e2f930077",
      "oldEvidenceDraftSHA256": "d86e3e8fb47cfffde8cbe32b9d279fd1ee4e7d3dbbb59b0a5db321e2d8af1841",
      "oldEvidenceProfileSHA256": "50dcabe592bce227b6942e1141023bfdbef1a853ab787e128bb9b05433e16aae",
      "newEvidenceSHA256": "a5bc44926b7ca7feffd0c1d7550f1c3a097051c1c255c19dd502472e9297ec58",
      "rationaleJa": "章節番号の案内だけだったfactを、固定WEB該当節が具体的に述べる行為・対象へ置換。意味範囲・地名同定は引用文を超えて広げない。"
    },
    {
      "draftPath": "drafts/places_3/2CH_holy_place_575.json",
      "entityID": "place:holy_place_575",
      "field": "profile.facts[2].textJa",
      "knownBy": {
        "chapter": 35,
        "verse": 5
      },
      "sourceID": "webp-2ch-35-5",
      "fixedWEBText": "Stand in the holy place according to the divisions of the fathers’ houses of your brothers the children of the people, and let there be for each a portion of a fathers’ house of the Levites.",
      "beforeTextJa": "35章5節にもこの場所名が現れます。",
      "afterTextJa": "ヨシヤは祭司やレビ人の組ごとに聖所へ立つよう命じ、レビ人の家系ごとに奉仕の持ち場を割り当てます。",
      "oldDraftSHA256": "d63ada2d22f3965da9d6e885591aa1b72a824568d3eb71ede724cfb734d01e28",
      "newDraftSHA256": "cd331622bdb0d63451983d29a6235356100b4beabba4644446cc7948497bd29b",
      "newProfileSHA256": "bee2c5514eb6663e9f55eb648873e412283ffcafda64af4806614d509097066c",
      "oldEvidenceDraftSHA256": "67bdcf6a60c0b602ded5207f1224e90e9bcbabf86bc7be7ee67daaa347bce125",
      "oldEvidenceProfileSHA256": "dbf3820b20e3d9bf25ed9b94d017ad0f76040a5e5ffb3447ea262e0e2f930077",
      "newEvidenceSHA256": "ade6260189652733f1700976e624e46f77e7b34d673dd04db161eda9571fdd6c",
      "rationaleJa": "章節番号の案内だけだったfactを、固定WEB該当節が具体的に述べる行為・対象へ置換。意味範囲・地名同定は引用文を超えて広げない。"
    },
    {
      "draftPath": "drafts/places_3/2CH_tarshish_1139.json",
      "entityID": "place:tarshish_1139",
      "field": "profile.facts[0].textJa",
      "knownBy": {
        "chapter": 20,
        "verse": 36
      },
      "sourceID": "webp-2ch-20-36",
      "fixedWEBText": "He joined himself with him to make ships to go to Tarshish. They made the ships in Ezion Geber.",
      "beforeTextJa": "20章36節にもこの場所名が現れます。",
      "afterTextJa": "ヨシャファトはアハズヤと組み、タルシシュへ向かう船を造りました。船はエツヨン・ゲベルで造られたと記されます。",
